around a lot more recently, our orchards have been destroyed and the local market has been affected as well.","nextNodeIds":[3600110]},{"nodeId":3600110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"Amber","textMapHash":3518711667,"text":"When the storms hit, we usually end up with at least a few injuries, so the Knights of Favonius have been tied up doing the best they can to defend the area.","nextNodeIds":[3600111]},{"nodeId":3600111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2742313571,"text":"So these annoying creatures have been getting closer and closer to the city?","nextNodeIds":[3600112]},{"nodeId":3600112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"Amber","textMapHash":1196631243,"text":"Exactly. That said, clearing this camp helped make the area a little bit safer.","nextNodeIds":[3600113]},{"nodeId":3600113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"Amber","textMapHash":993421155,"text":"Come with me! A responsible knight must make sure to see you to the city safely.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3600105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1188435075,"text":"Those things are tougher than they look.","nextNodeIds":[3600106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[36001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133003136,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1002"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":3